## USA Housing - Linear Regression

This project applies simple linear regression on the USA Housing dataset to predict house prices.

## Dataset
- Name: USA Housing  
- Features:
  - Avg Area Income  
  - Avg Area House Age  
  - Avg Area Number of Rooms  
  - Avg Area Number of Bedrooms  
  - Area Population  
- Target:
  - Price  

## Objective
To build a linear regression model that predicts house prices based on input features.

## Steps Performed
1. Loaded dataset using pandas  
2. Checked and cleaned data  
3. Performed exploratory data analysis  
4. Split data into training and testing sets  
5. Trained Linear Regression model  
6. Evaluated model performance  

## Tools Used
- Python  
- Pandas  
- NumPy  
- Matplotlib  
- Seaborn  
- Scikit-learn  

## Model Evaluation
- MAE (Mean Absolute Error)  
- MSE (Mean Squared Error)  
- RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error)  
- R² Score  

## Output
The model predicts house prices based on given input features and shows a linear relationship between income and price.
